OL,3,GNEWSA'Uneventful' budget draws mixed
OL,4,Areaction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA promise to shield households from
OL,7,Fsome cost of living pressures was the
OL,8,Ffocus of John Healey's first budget as
OL,9,Fchancellor.
OL,11,FHe described his plans as offering
OL,12,Ffamilies "breathing space", with
OL,13,Fmeasures including support for some
OL,14,Fhouseholds facing rising energy costs
OL,15,Fand changes to business rates.
OL,17,FBut reaction across Shropshire was
OL,18,Fmixed, with businesses, charities and
OL,19,Fpoliticians divided over whether the
OL,20,Fmeasures will go far enough.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
