OL,3,GNEWSA'Uneventful' budget draws mixed
OL,4,Areaction
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Delves, who runs Tuffins
OL,7,FSupermarket in Craven Arms, said there
OL,8,Fwas little in the announcement that
OL,9,Fwould significantly affect his
OL,10,Fbusiness.
